                            10
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتَوْخَمَهُ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>He found it</i> (food) <i>to be unwholesome;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَوَخَّمَهُ</span></b> : (JK, K:) <i>he
found it</i> (a land) <i>to be insalubrious:</i> (TA:) <i>he
found it</i> (a country or town) <i>to disagree with</i>
                        
                        <i>its inhabitants.</i> (S, Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا أَسْتَوْخِمُ أَنْ</span>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَصْحَبَكَ</span>: see 5 in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جدب</span>.

